  // The day-1 tour in the "Get to know Isa" step (J-02): one card at a time.
  "tour": [
    { "title": "Ask about running your chapter", "text": "Isa answers questions about running your chapter, from ISACA's approved guidance for chapter leaders. Type a question in your own words, one at a time." },
    { "title": "Every answer shows where it came from", "text": "Isa answers only from ISACA's approved documents. Under each answer you'll see its sources, and \"Show the steps\" shows how she found it." },
